WEBVTT

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.500
[both panting]

00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:13.958
[panting]

00:00:18.708 --> 00:00:20.916
Okay, I go left,
and you go right?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.000
[panting] Uh, yeah.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:25.958
Or...

00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:33.458
[panting]

00:00:33.541 --> 00:00:35.791
[engine starts]

00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:38.250
[horn honking]

00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:40.750
-[Pawbert exclaims]
-[Judy laughs]

00:00:40.833 --> 00:00:42.500
[Judy]
You are a horrible driver.

00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:44.083
[Nick] Yes, I am.

00:00:47.208 --> 00:00:48.250
[exclaiming]

00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:49.458
[both laughing]

00:00:52.083 --> 00:00:53.458
[Judy grunts] Whoa.

00:00:54.291 --> 00:00:55.208
[Nick chuckles]

00:00:59.416 --> 00:01:00.833
I'm gonna jump! [grunts]

00:01:05.125 --> 00:01:07.791
[grunts] Zoogetherness. Huh?

00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:09.708
No, never mind.
Forget I said it. Here we go.

00:01:09.791 --> 00:01:11.375
[both grunt]

00:01:11.458 --> 00:01:12.666
-[Nick, Judy grunt]
-[Pawbert exclaims]

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:15.125
Matches, matches,
matches, matches.

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:16.916
[panting, gasps]

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.208
Bunnies, we're burrowers.

00:01:18.291 --> 00:01:19.208
Rabbit kick. Hi-yah!

00:01:19.291 --> 00:01:20.500
[Pawbert exclaims]

00:01:21.833 --> 00:01:22.875
[yells]

00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:24.166
[Nick, Judy grunt]

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.458
I'll destroy the patent,

00:01:25.541 --> 00:01:27.875
that town
and everything in it.

00:01:27.958 --> 00:01:31.166
And a dirtbag fox
and a dumb bunny

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:33.791
will never stand in my way.

00:01:33.875 --> 00:01:35.250
[straining]
She's not a dumb bunny,

00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:37.041
and you're forgetting
one thing.

00:01:37.125 --> 00:01:38.125
What's that?

00:01:38.208 --> 00:01:39.583
[straining]
We're friends with a snake.

00:01:40.666 --> 00:01:42.958
-Howdy, partner. [vocalizes]
-[Pawbert screams]

00:01:43.041 --> 00:01:44.416
-Heads up!
-[grunts]

00:01:45.375 --> 00:01:46.375
[grunts]

00:01:46.458 --> 00:01:49.916
-[groans] Daddy!
-Daddy's busy.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.833
Brian! Go!

00:01:51.916 --> 00:01:54.583
-You say justice is dead...
-[grunts]

00:01:54.666 --> 00:01:56.833
-...I say neigh!
-[grunts]

00:01:57.666 --> 00:01:59.000
[yelling]

00:01:59.083 --> 00:02:01.166
Ha-cha! [grunts]

00:02:03.541 --> 00:02:06.500
-[Gary] Here, kitty-kitty.
-No! [grunts]

00:02:06.583 --> 00:02:08.625
It's called an arrest,
sweetheart.

00:02:08.708 --> 00:02:09.708
Boom.

00:02:10.625 --> 00:02:12.208
[screaming]

00:02:12.291 --> 00:02:13.333
[grunts]

00:02:14.625 --> 00:02:19.500
[chuckles] No one
will believe you over us.

00:02:20.166 --> 00:02:22.666
We've always
been better than you.

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:24.791
And we always will be.

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:29.208
Nothing you do matters.

00:02:30.458 --> 00:02:33.583
Well, it matters to him.

00:02:33.666 --> 00:02:35.041
[♪ gentle music playing]

00:02:35.125 --> 00:02:36.458
Shall we?

00:03:13.166 --> 00:03:14.208
[gasps]

00:03:18.625 --> 00:03:20.000
[breathes shakily]

00:03:20.083 --> 00:03:21.666
[♪ sentimental music playing]

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:30.541
[Judy] Hmm.

00:03:40.625 --> 00:03:41.875
[gasps]

00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:47.958
One long sock. [sniffles]

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.250
[breathes deeply]

00:04:20.375 --> 00:04:22.541
[gasps] Oh.

00:04:22.625 --> 00:04:24.625
[♪ sentimental music
continues]

